      "Utilities begin posting: Duke, PG&E, PGE, PacifiCorp, Puget Sound Energy, Avista, Idaho Power, BPA via USAJOBS.",
      "Check the OSU Winter Engineering Career Fair date (typically February) and repeat the October prep."
